{
  "$comment": "Summit Run contract freeze (task 1.2). Every constant here is normative for all later lanes: client rules, server reducer, protocol validators, prediction, interpolation and fixtures. Source of truth: openspec/changes/add-multiplayer-snowboard-arcade/design.md D4-D7. Changing any value requires updating the golden fixtures and the JS/Elixir ports together, and bumping rulesVersion when simulation semantics change.",
